gs Utility power consumption.</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<table>\n<tr><td>Thank you for supporting your local veteran owned and</td><td>SUBTOTAL</td><td>1,550.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td>operated small business.</td><td>TAX</td><td>0.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>TOTAL</td><td>1,550.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>BALANCE DUE</td><td>$1,550.00</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nPage 1 of 1\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01kxyvcr87v7z1e66nw8bzh3r6 -->",
